<br/>Uz to tek se maleni broj proizvođača svojim kalkulatorima uspio nametnuti tržištu zbog kvalitete, niske cijene ili zanimljivih inovacija. <br/></div><div class="qr-and-instructions"><div class="qr-container"><img src="/assets/images/final/64da230b62786b295daa9ab5_image.png" loading="lazy" alt="QR kod za AR iskustvo proširene stvarnosti" class="image qr"/><div class="text-block-3">Skeniraj kod mobitelom i uperi kameru u sliku da pokreneš AR.</div></div></div></div><div data-hero-variant="desktop" class="heroheader05_image-wrapper"><div class="image-group"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/64de57d0e48d4e9475155c41_Velike-svjetske-marke.png" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" height="" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 559.169921875px, 56vw" alt="Abak - antički kalkulator" data-srcset="/assets/images/final/64de57d0e48d4e9475155c41_Velike-svjetske-marke.png 700w" class="heroheader05_image hero-image-size image-size-large image-svjetski"/><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/64da24687196d1736389be23_Pozadina za sliku.svg" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" alt="image background" class="image-background hidden-image-background"/><div class="w-layout-hflex ar-and-copyright"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/64db374e19c92a97dd217809_AR ikona - s.png" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" alt="irene stvarnosti" class="image-2"/><div class="text-copyright-or-title">Tradicionalni kineski abacus</div></div></div><div class="qr-and-instructions tablet"><div class="qr-container"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/64da230b62786b295daa9ab5_image.png" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" alt=