ntainer-large-2"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid layout58_component image-right"><div id="w-node-_794afc66-56ad-e71f-0f2a-85ab594f468e-9cb8e1f9" class="layout58_content"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xsmall"><h3 class="heading-medium">Tipkovnice<br/></h3></div><div class="layout58_image-wrapper mobile-view-image"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/64da24687196d1736389be23_Pozadina za sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left image-opacity"/><img src="/assets/images/final/64de58a1c7e80cfdee16e9b4_Tipkovnica.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/64de58a1c7e80cfdee16e9b4_Tipkovnica.png 600w" alt="Tipkovnice" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 631px) 95vw, (max-width: 767px) 600px, 100vw" class="featured-image image-size-no-background"/></div></div><div class="text-size-large-2">Ako pogledate tipkovnicu vašeg mobitela i tipkovnicu kalkulatora kojeg imate na mobitelu primijetit ćete da su sasvim obrnute. <br/><br/>Prvi red tipki na kalkulatorima je 7-8-9, dok je na telefonima 1-2-3.</div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-row-2 is-reverse-mobile-landscape"><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="button-secondary-gray w-inline-block"><div>Get started</div></a></div><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="uui-button w-inline-block"><div>Learn more</div></a></div></div></div></div><div class="layout58_image-wrapper mobile-view-hidden"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/64da24687196d1736389be23_Pozadina za sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left image-opacity"/><img src="/assets/images/final/64de58a1c7e80cfdee16e9b4_Tipkovnica.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/64de58a1c7e80cfdee16e9b4_Tipkovnica.png 600w" alt="Dashboard mockup" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 431.640625px, 44vw" class="featured-image image-size-no-background"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_layout58"><div class="page-padding"><div class="container-large-2"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid layout58_component"><div class="layout58_image-wrapper mobile-view-hidden"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/64da24687196d1736389be23_Pozadina za sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left image-opacity"/><img src="/assets/images/final/6500518ed101e433e2579fe4_Sundstrand keyboard machine.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/6500518ed101e433e2579fe4_Sundstrand keyboard machine.png 700w" alt="Dashboard mockup" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 244.580078125px, 25vw" class="featured-image image-size-no-background image-logo-mobile-size"/></div></div><div id="w-node-_862e6be8-be15-c53f-c07c-ee15542aa196-9cb8e1f9" class="layout58_content"><div class="layout58_image-wrapper mobile-view-image"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/64da24687196d1736389be23_Pozadina za sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left image-opacity"/><img src="/assets/images/final/6500518ed101e433e2579fe4_Sundstrand keyboard machine.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/6500518ed101e433e2579fe4_Sundstrand keyboard machine.png 700w" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 736px) 95vw, (max-width: 767px) 700px, 100vw" class="featured-image image-size-no-background"/></div></div><div class="text-size-large-2">Kroz povijest se eksperimentiralo s raznim varijantama, a kad je David Sundstrand 1914. patentirao tipkovnicu za kalkulatore kakvu danas poznajemo velika većina proizvođača kalkulatora su je prihvatili kao neko pravilo bez obzira što ne postoji razlog zašto bi taj raspored bio bolji.</div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-row-2 is-reverse-mobile-landscape"><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="button-secondary-gray w-inline-block"><div>Get started</div></a></div><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="uui-button w-inline-block"><div>Learn more</div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>